ess_gates | -1 | The strategy's Prerequisites & Process Gates list seven pending human review gates (Architecture Review, ODH/RHOAI Build Onboarding, Licence Validation, Accelerator/Package Support, Documentation Support, UXD Support, Performance Team Support) that precede all implementation work — the epic's code changes require these human approval steps before landing. SRE/Support coordination on alert rules adds further human-in-the-loop verification. |\n15\t| repo_access | +1 | The rhods-operator repository (`red-hat-data-services/rhods-operator`) is a standard Git repository documented in the architecture context; it can be cloned and modified directly. |\n16\t| architecture_claims | +1 | The epic's premise is corroborated by `.context/architecture-context/architecture/rhoai-3.6-ea.1/rhods-operator.md`: it confirms controller-runtime/logr usage (`sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime` v0.24.1, `go-logr/logr`), the DSC/DSCInitialization CRDs, the eight component controllers, the service controllers (Auth, Gateway, Monitoring), and the manager binary — grounding the conversion scope. |\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8ce0563ea5245d8c","agent_id":"aedaccdf93b6b217c","session_id":"f64427cd-cf3e-4bee-9716-c63ae53a7129","uuid":"8777f1a6-f579-4297-86e1-baf88d756b50","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:45:51.235Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3f7926b434197f2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8010 after revision"}
